* AD4021 ADC Front End
.lib AD4021.sub

* Primary DC Input
VIN IN 0 1V
VIN_MINUS IN_N 0 0V

* Reference Voltage
VREF REF 0 5V
CREF REF 0 10u

* Power Supplies
VDD VDD 0 1.8V
CVDD VDD 0 100n
VVIO VIO 0 1.8V
CVIO VIO 0 100n

* Conversion Clock & Digital Interface
* CNV initiates the conversion (500 kHz sampling rate)
VCNV CNV 0 PULSE(0 1.8 100n 1n 1n 400n 2u)

* SCK clocks out the data after conversion completes (50 MHz, 20 cycles)
VSCK SCK 0 PULSE(0 1.8 600n 1n 1n 10n 20n 20)

* SDI tied low for standard single-device operation
VSDI SDI 0 0V

* Load capacitance on the digital output
COUT OUT 0 10p

* AD4021 Instantiation 
* Typical ADI SAR ADC pin order: IN+ IN- REF VDD VIO GND CNV SDI SCK SDO
X1 IN IN_N REF VDD VIO 0 CNV SDI SCK OUT AD4021

* Transient Analysis to capture multiple conversion cycles
.tran 0 5u

.end
